OL,3,AHundreds more prisoners to be freed in
OL,4,Asecond phase of early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 650 more offenders will leave
OL,7,Fjails in England and Wales early on
OL,8,FTuesday in the second phase of the
OL,9,Fgovernment's plan to tackle the prison
OL,10,Fpopulation crisis.
OL,12,FThe group will include offenders
OL,13,Fserving up to two and a half years for
OL,14,Fcrimes.
OL,16,FUnder the new rules, they are leaving
OL,17,Fjail after serving a third of their
OL,18,Fsentence behind bars, rather than half.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
