OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitte, who lived with cerebral palsy,
OL,7,Fdrew on his own experience for his role
OL,8,Fas Walter 'Flynn' White Jr in the
OL,9,FEmmy-winning drama series starring
OL,10,FBryan Cranston and Aaron Paul. He
OL,11,Fearned a Screen Actors Guild Award in
OL,12,F2014 for his work on the series.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
