OL,3,ASix Ukrainian energy sites hit by
OL,4,ARussia since Trump announced ceasefire,
OL,5,AZelensky says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia struck six Ukrainian energy
OL,8,Ffacilities hours after US President
OL,9,FDonald Trump announced the two
OL,10,Fcountries had agreed to an energy
OL,11,Fceasefire, Volodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,13,FDespite Trump stating on Sunday the
OL,14,Ftruce would be "effective immediately",
OL,15,Fthe Ukrainian president said Russia had
OL,16,Fhit "our gas stations, energy
OL,17,Finfrastructure, and other facilities".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
